Z||000000||Gokart||09-26-2000||04:52 PM||||Haven't posted here lately and wanted to let you all know you've been and will be missed <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Gokart'sgirl and I are splitting up and I'm giving her the computer and will no longer have internet access. I've been going through a heck of a time right now in my life. I also quit my job with UPS after 11 years. Don't know if it's my "mid-life crisis" or not but I need to straighten some things up for myself before I can feel like doing anything Fiero related again. Hope I won't be too long and that I still will have the great friends I've met through the Fiero community. Thanks for this place Cliff <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> It's been my "safe haven" for 18 months. I'll be back <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gokart_sig_1.gif">  <P>Marc                     87GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||hugh||09-26-2000||06:55 PM||||Take care of yourself,good luck in whatever you finally decide to do.Just remember that whatever happens,it could have been worse(even if it doesn't seem that way now)Hurry back.Hugh ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||09-26-2000||07:24 PM||||geez.. I never know what to say in a situation like this... I'll miss talking to you over email, and on the forum.<P>but it's good to hear that you'll be back online.. I hope you get this all figured out soon..<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||9
Z||000003||Patrick||09-26-2000||07:31 PM||||<BR><B>Marc</B>, I'm sorry to hear that things have gone a little sour in your life lately. I've enjoyed the chit-chat we've shared over the last year and a half and I hope things get straightend out for you quickly. You've always been one of the good guys here, so I hope that your return will be sooner rather than later.||||reg||9
Z||000004||Coconut||09-26-2000||07:38 PM||||GoKart,<BR>  Man, I hope things will soon get better for ya. I feel bad for the split up between you and GG <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. Although change is an integral part of growth, it can be painful. I hope that if you both have decided to go your separate ways, it was at least amiable.<P>Whatever you do, keep your focus and "fight the Good Fight". Know that you have friends that are rooting for the both of you. You will be missed, and when you've got things back in perspective, you will find a bunch of Fieroholics eager to welcome you HOME <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Vaya con Dios Amigo & hope to hear from you very soon!<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
